  "subject": "a rookie paddler on a Tuen Ng dragon boat crew at Stanley who keeps losing the drummer's beat and splashing the whole boat",
  "caption": "Cantonese hard-dance pop with a hardstyle edge. Distorted hardstyle kick on every beat, offbeat reverse-bass stabs, a bright supersaw lead riff answering the vocal, snare-roll risers before each chorus, deep sub-bass under the drops. Loud, punchy club master with heavy sidechain pump and a dry vocal sitting on top. A bright female mid-range lead with a fast clipped chant delivery, friends shouting answer lines in a gang vocal. 150 BPM, F minor. Frantic, cheeky and laughing at itself. No trap hi-hats, no autotune, no slow ballad section, no rap verse, no dubstep wobble.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n赤柱海邊 端午朝早\n我第一次 坐上龍舟\n隊長話 你跟住個鼓\n一下一下 唔好亂嚟\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n鼓手大叔 眼都唔眨\n咚 咚 咚 佢叫我睇實\n\n[Chorus]\n跟唔到鼓 跟唔到鼓\n我條槳 又快咗半步\n成隻船 畀我濺到濕晒\n跟唔到鼓 對唔住呀大佬\n\n[Verse]\n前面阿姐 回頭瞪我\n後面阿叔 笑到咳\n我數一二 佢打三四\n個浪仲大過我嘅決心\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n鼓手大叔 停一停手\n佢話 細路 唔好望槳 聽我\n\n[Chorus]\n跟唔到鼓 跟唔到鼓\n閉埋眼 我淨係聽佢個鼓\n成隻船 終於齊齊一下\n跟得到鼓 好似裝咗摩打\n\n[Bridge]\n咚 咚 咚 咚\n一齊落 一齊起\n\n[Chorus]\n跟得到鼓 跟得到鼓\n衝過終點 輸咗都唔緊要\n成隻船 濕晒但係笑晒\n跟得到鼓 明年再嚟過\n\n[Outro]\n食糉啦 食糉啦",
